      "start_time": 96.475,
      "end_time": 97.267
    },
    {
      "text": "Andy's not joining so get started.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 97.411,
      "end_time": 100.695
    },
    {
      "text": "So Jack, tsg, we're going to get the data room up and running today or.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 103.395,
      "end_time": 110.571
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, okay, cool.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 110.763,
      "end_time": 112.523
    },
    {
      "text": "Well it's going to be up and then I'm going to share it with them.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 112.619,
      "end_time": 116.255
    },
    {
      "text": "I've pulled hopefully what's right.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 117.075,
      "end_time": 119.815
    },
    {
      "text": "I think it is quite self explanatory the platform but obviously we just don't want the liability of it.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 121.315,
      "end_time": 126.531
    },
    {
      "text": "They want us to have the liability of it obviously.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 126.643,
      "end_time": 128.731
    },
    {
      "text": "But.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 128.803,
      "end_time": 129.415
    },
    {
      "text": "The.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 131.485,
      "end_time": 132.225
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, there are a lot of.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 133.605,
      "end_time": 134.653
    },
    {
      "text": "There are a lot of questions coming back.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 134.709,
      "end_time": 136.505
    },
    {
      "text": "I think we've got the answers to most of them but there's some operational questions that shirt still needs to answer.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 137.565,
      "end_time": 142.345
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I mean I didn't like that question.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 142.845,
      "end_time": 144.957
    },
    {
      "text": "The you know, what have you been doing for the last 20 years basically, you know.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 145.061,
      "end_time": 150.429
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 150.597,
      "end_time": 151.385
    },
    {
      "text": "But it is what it is.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 151.805,
      "end_time": 153.425
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't think we ask it in that way but it's.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 153.845,
      "end_time": 156.785
    },
    {
      "text": "That was.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 157.355,
      "end_time": 157.747
    },
    {
      "text": "This was.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 157.771,
      "end_time": 158.203
    },
    {
      "text": "That was almost verbatim what whoever asked that though.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 158.259,
      "end_time": 161.739
    },
    {
      "text": "Right?",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 161.787,
      "end_time": 162.375
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 163.035,
      "end_time": 163.779
    },
    {
      "text": "I think, I think the question is what's.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 163.827,
      "end_time": 167.075
    },
    {
      "text": "What's caused the sudden surge in EBITDA growth rather than why for 20.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 167.155,
      "end_time": 173.355
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 173.475,
      "end_time": 173.955
    },
    {
      "text": "I.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 173.995,
      "end_time": 174.291
    },
    {
      "text": "If I was Stuart, I probably wouldn't react that well to that question.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 174.363,
      "end_time": 177.323
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 177.459,
      "end_time": 179.015
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 181.075,
      "end_time": 181.747
    },
    {
      "text": "Just like please explain why.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 181.891,
      "end_time": 184.043
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, why the businesses?",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 184.219,
      "end_time": 186.139
    },
    {
      "text": "Because he says the business.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 186.227,
      "end_time": 187.483
    },
    {
      "text": "He.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 187.579,
      "end_time": 187.979
    },
    {
      "text": "He's got a reason for this.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 188.067,
      "end_time": 189.227
    },
    {
      "text": "I can probably answer the question.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 189.251,
      "end_time": 190.339
    },
    {
      "text": "It's the pre and post covered.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 190.387,
      "end_time": 192.763
    },
    {
      "text": "Post covered.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 192.859,
      "end_time": 193.451
    },
    {
      "text": "The business looks totally different and they expanded in a way that they never thought possible.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 193.483,
      "end_time": 198.135
    },
    {
      "text": "It's basically the way that they say it.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 198.915,
      "end_time": 200.775
    },
    {
      "text": "I will, yeah, I'll.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 201.635,
      "end_time": 202.843
    },
    {
      "text": "I'll put that question to Stuart and hopefully he doesn't react too poorly.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 202.899,
      "end_time": 207.055
    },
    {
      "text": "And you got the.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 209.875,
      "end_time": 211.171
    },
    {
      "text": "That email I sent for DD or I.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 211.283,
      "end_time": 215.481
