    {
      "text": "They're not spending much time each but 11 minutes spent total over seven visits and let me have a Look, yeah, I mean they are spending time, spending 20 seconds on financials, quite a lot of time on key figures, which I think might be.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 247.155,
      "end_time": 275.145
