    {
      "text": "Yeah, I mean 31 visits to the OR, 30 visits to the financials page.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 276.205,
      "end_time": 281.345
    },
    {
      "text": "And Fine Line is Fine Light.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 282.885,
      "end_time": 285.465
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, they've.",
