      "start_time": 303.433,
      "end_time": 304.121
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 304.233,
      "end_time": 304.705
    },
    {
      "text": "I think so.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 304.785,
      "end_time": 305.241
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 305.273,
      "end_time": 305.457
    },
    {
      "text": "I think they're asking questions to get down to the point where they're putting in an offer.",
      "speaker_name": "Jack Chiappe",
      "start_time": 305.481,
      "end_time": 309.585
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 309.745,
      "end_time": 310.193
    },
    {
      "text": "That's my view for Zen.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 310.249,
      "end_time": 312.697
    },
    {
      "text": "You got the.",
