      "start_time": 322.065,
      "end_time": 327.045
    },
    {
      "text": "They're in Reno, Nevada.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 327.355,
      "end_time": 329.459
    },
    {
      "text": "I've been talking to the CEO for a couple years.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 329.547,
      "end_time": 333.615
    },
    {
      "text": "He wants to buy a company now.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 334.955,
      "end_time": 337.175
    },
    {
      "text": "3 to 4 million in revenue.",
      "speaker_name": "David Tsutsumi",
      "start_time": 338.035,
      "end_time": 339.935
    },
    {
      "text": "So I did send him the Zen opportunity, but definitely try to pitch him on the buy side.",
