    {
      "text": "Yeah, about that.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 393.001,
      "end_time": 394.817
    },
    {
      "text": "So we got this new company.",
      "speaker_name": "Ahmed Zia",
      "start_time": 394.881,
      "end_time": 396.825
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know if you guys saw this.",
